msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Scrobbles what you watch in Kodi and syncs your library with Trakt"
msgstr "Ka scrobble i āu e mātaki ai i Kodi, ka tukutahi i tō pātaka ki Trakt"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Trakt Relay scrobbles the movies, episodes, live TV and recordings you watch in Kodi to Trakt, and syncs your library with it: collection, watched status, ratings and playback progress, each direction switched on in the settings. It asks for a rating after you watch, and its context menu rates, adds to the watchlist and starts a rewatch of a show. Scrobbles that fail are retried later.[CR][CR]Trakt Relay is a modified version of script.trakt by Trakt.tv, Razzeee and its contributors."
msgstr "Ka scrobble a Trakt Relay ki Trakt i ngā kiriata, ngā wāhanga, te TV Ora me ngā hopukanga e mātakitakina ana e koe i Kodi, ka tukutahi hoki i tō pātaka ki reira: te kohinga, te tūnga mātaki, ngā whakatauranga me te kauneke whakatākaro, ka whakahohea ia ahunga i ngā tautuhinga. Ka tono whakatauranga i muri i tō mātakitanga, ā, mā tōna tahua horopaki e whakatau, e tāpiri ki te rārangi mātaki, e tīmata i te mātaki anō i tētahi hōtaka. Ka ngana anō ā muri ake ngā scrobble i rahua.[CR][CR]He putanga kua whakarerekētia a Trakt Relay o script.trakt nā Trakt.tv, nā Razzeee me ōna kaiwhai wāhi."

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Trakt Relay is not affiliated with or endorsed by Trakt."
msgstr "Kāore a Trakt Relay i te hono ki a Trakt, kāore hoki i te tautokohia e Trakt."

