msgctxt "#32212"
msgid "Shows you are rewatching on Trakt match your rewatch progress in Kodi. Episodes watched since the rewatch started are marked watched, and the rest unwatched. Start a rewatch from a show's context menu or on Trakt."
msgstr "I Kodi, ka ōrite ngā hōtaka e mātaki anō ana koe i Trakt ki tō kauneke mātaki anō. Ko ngā wāhanga kua mātakitakina mai i te tīmatanga o te mātaki anō ka tohua kia mātakitakina, ā, ko ētahi atu kia kore e mātakitakina. Tīmatahia he mātaki anō mai i te tahua horopaki o tētahi hōtaka, i Trakt rānei."

msgctxt "#32213"
msgid "Movie sync"
msgstr "Tukutahi kiriata"

msgctxt "#32214"
