msgctxt "#32217"
msgid "Watching"
msgstr "E mātaki ana"

msgctxt "#32218"
msgid "The Trakt add-on is also enabled. Both add-ons scrobble and sync with Trakt, so everything is done twice."
msgstr "Kua whakahohea anō te tāpiringa Trakt. Ka scrobble, ka tukutahi ngā tāpiringa e rua ki Trakt, nō reira ka mahia ngā mea katoa e rua ngā wā."

msgctxt "#32219"
msgid "Keep both"
msgstr "Puritia ngā mea e rua"

msgctxt "#32220"
msgid "Start rewatch"
msgstr "Tīmata mātaki anō"

msgctxt "#32221"
msgid "Start a rewatch on Trakt? Your progress starts again, and every episode is marked unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Me tīmata he mātaki anō i Trakt? Ka tīmata anō tō kauneke, ā, ka tohua ia wāhanga kia kore e mātakitakina i Kodi."

msgctxt "#32222"
msgid "Rewatch started"
msgstr "Kua tīmata te mātaki anō"

msgctxt "#32223"
msgid "Couldn't start rewatch"
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tīmata i te mātaki anō"

msgctxt "#32224"
msgid "Use the OG Trakt theme"
msgstr "Whakamahi te kaupapa OG Trakt"

msgctxt "#32225"
msgid "Shows Trakt's red logo, hearts and highlights, as on og.trakt.tv."
msgstr "Ka whakaatu i te waitohu whero o Trakt, ngā manawa me ngā miramira, pērā i og.trakt.tv."

msgctxt "#32226"
msgid "%i couldn't be synced"
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tukutahi i ngā mea %i"

msgctxt "#32227"
msgid "Your Trakt account is locked. Contact Trakt support."
msgstr "Kua rakaina tō pūkete Trakt. Whakapā atu ki te tautoko a Trakt."

msgctxt "#32228"
msgid "Watchlist limit of %i reached"
msgstr "Kua tae ki te tepe %i o te rārangi mātaki"

msgctxt "#32229"
msgid "Choose what to sync"
msgstr "Kōwhiria ngā mea hei tukutahi"

msgctxt "#32230"
msgid "Open the sync setup shown after connecting to Trakt."
msgstr "Ka whakatuwhera i te tatūnga tukutahi ka whakaaturia i muri i te hono ki Trakt."

msgctxt "#32231"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean. Otherwise a sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Tukutahi ina oti i a Kodi te matawai, te horoi rānei i te pātaka. Ki te kore, ka rere noa te tukutahi ina tīmatahia e koe, hei tauira, mai i te tahua horopaki."

msgctxt "#32232"
msgid "Notify when a sync after a library scan or clean starts and finishes."
msgstr "Whakamōhio ina tīmata, ina oti hoki tētahi tukutahi i muri i te matawai, te horoi rānei i te pātaka."

msgctxt "#32233"
msgid "Show no sync notifications while a video plays."
msgstr "Kaua e whakaatu whakamōhiotanga tukutahi i te wā e whakatākaro ana tētahi ataata."

msgctxt "#32234"
msgid "Match items without an IMDb, TMDB or TVDB id by title and year, when scrobbling and syncing. Never used to unwatch items or clear ratings."
msgstr "Whakaōrite i ngā tūemi kāore he ID IMDb, TMDB, TVDB rānei mā te taitara me te tau, i te wā scrobble me te tukutahi. Kāore rawa e whakamahia hei tohu i ngā tūemi kia kore e mātakitakina, hei ūkui rānei i ngā whakatauranga."

msgctxt "#32235"
msgid "Watched status"
msgstr "Tūnga mātaki"

msgctxt "#32236"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included, and anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched. Kodi to Trakt: items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Both ways: each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Trakt ki Kodi: ka ōrite a Kodi ki a Trakt, tae atu ki ngā tatau whakatākaro me ngā rā, ā, ko ngā mea kāore he whakatākaro i Trakt ka tohua kia kore e mātakitakina. Kodi ki Trakt: ko ngā tūemi kua mātakitakina i Kodi kāore he whakatākaro i Trakt ka tāpiria ki tōna hītori. Ngā ahunga e rua: ka whiwhi ia taha i ngā whakatākaro e ngaro ana i a ia, ā, kāore he mea e tohua kia kore e mātakitakina i waho i tētahi mātaki anō i Trakt."

msgctxt "#32237"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Weto"

msgctxt "#32238"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi"
msgstr "Trakt ki Kodi"

msgctxt "#32239"
msgid "Kodi to Trakt"
msgstr "Kodi ki Trakt"

msgctxt "#32240"
msgid "Both ways"
msgstr "Ngā ahunga e rua"

msgctxt "#32241"
msgid "Ratings"
msgstr "Whakatauranga"

msgctxt "#32242"
msgid "Movies, shows and episodes"
msgstr "Ngā kiriata, ngā hōtaka me ngā wāhanga"

msgctxt "#32243"
msgid "Trakt to Kodi: Kodi matches Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi. Kodi to Trakt: Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Both ways: missing ratings are copied each way, and where they differ Trakt's is kept."
msgstr "Trakt ki Kodi: ka ōrite a Kodi ki a Trakt, ā, ko ngā whakatauranga kāore i a Trakt ka ūkuia i Kodi. Kodi ki Trakt: ka tāpiria ngā whakatauranga o Kodi ki Trakt, hei whakakapi i ngā mea rerekē. Ngā ahunga e rua: ka tāruatia ngā whakatauranga ngaro ki ia ahunga, ā, ki te rerekē, ka puritia te whakatauranga o Trakt."

msgctxt "#32244"
msgid "Resume points from Trakt"
msgstr "Ngā wāhi haere tonu mai i Trakt"

msgctxt "#32245"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device. Playback in Kodi still sends its progress to Trakt when this is off."
msgstr "Ka haere tonu a Kodi i te wāhi i whakatārewatia ai te tūemi i Trakt, hei tauira, mai i tētahi atu pūrere. Ka tukuna tonu e te whakatākaro i Kodi tōna kauneke ki Trakt ina weto tēnei."

msgctxt "#32246"
msgid "Add"
msgstr "Tāpiri"

msgctxt "#32247"
msgid "Add and remove"
msgstr "Tāpiri me te tango"

msgctxt "#32248"
msgid "Add: Kodi's items are added to the Trakt collection. Add and remove: collected items Kodi doesn't have are removed from it too, including ones from other devices or apps."
msgstr "Tāpiri: ka tāpiria ngā tūemi o Kodi ki te kohinga Trakt. Tāpiri me te tango: ko ngā tūemi o te kohinga kāore i a Kodi ka tangohia hoki, tae atu ki ērā nō ētahi atu pūrere, taupānga rānei."

msgctxt "#32249"
msgid "Relay always scrobbles when connected. Sync handles what it didn't scrobble: other devices, older history."
msgstr "Ka scrobble a Relay i ngā wā katoa ina hono ana. Ka whakahaere te tukutahi i ngā mea kāore ia i scrobble: ētahi atu pūrere, hītori tawhito ake."

msgctxt "#32250"
msgid "On"
msgstr "Kā"

msgctxt "#32251"
msgid "Watched status isn't synced."
msgstr "Kāore te tūnga mātaki e tukutahitia."

msgctxt "#32252"
msgid "Kodi matches Trakt, play counts and dates included. Anything with no plays on Trakt is unwatched in Kodi."
msgstr "Ka ōrite a Kodi ki a Trakt, tae atu ki ngā tatau whakatākaro me ngā rā. Ko ngā mea kāore he whakatākaro i Trakt ka tohua kia kore e mātakitakina i Kodi."

msgctxt "#32253"
msgid "Items watched in Kodi with no play on Trakt are added to its history. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ko ngā tūemi kua mātakitakina i Kodi kāore he whakatākaro i Trakt ka tāpiria ki tōna hītori. Kāore a Kodi e whakarerekētia."

msgctxt "#32254"
msgid "Each side gets the plays it's missing, and nothing is unwatched outside a Trakt rewatch."
msgstr "Ka whiwhi ia taha i ngā whakatākaro e ngaro ana i a ia, ā, kāore he mea e tohua kia kore e mātakitakina i waho i tētahi mātaki anō i Trakt."

msgctxt "#32255"
msgid "Ratings aren't synced."
msgstr "Kāore ngā whakatauranga e tukutahitia."

msgctxt "#32256"
msgid "Kodi's ratings match Trakt, and ratings Trakt doesn't have are cleared in Kodi."
msgstr "Ka ōrite ngā whakatauranga o Kodi ki a Trakt, ā, ko ngā whakatauranga kāore i a Trakt ka ūkuia i Kodi."

msgctxt "#32257"
msgid "Kodi's ratings are added to Trakt, replacing different ones. Kodi isn't changed."
msgstr "Ka tāpiria ngā whakatauranga o Kodi ki Trakt, hei whakakapi i ngā mea rerekē. Kāore a Kodi e whakarerekētia."

msgctxt "#32258"
msgid "Missing ratings are copied each way. Where they differ, Trakt's rating is kept."
msgstr "Ka tāruatia ngā whakatauranga ngaro ki ia ahunga. Ki te rerekē, ka puritia te whakatauranga o Trakt."

msgctxt "#32259"
msgid "Kodi keeps its own resume points."
msgstr "Ka pupuri a Kodi i ōna ake wāhi haere tonu."

msgctxt "#32260"
msgid "Kodi resumes where Trakt has the item paused, such as from another device."
msgstr "Ka haere tonu a Kodi i te wāhi i whakatārewatia ai te tūemi i Trakt, hei tauira, mai i tētahi atu pūrere."

msgctxt "#32261"
msgid "A sync runs only when you start it, such as from the context menu."
msgstr "Ka rere noa te tukutahi ina tīmatahia e koe, hei tauira, mai i te tahua horopaki."

msgctxt "#32262"
msgid "Sync when Kodi finishes a library scan or clean."
msgstr "Ka tukutahi ina oti i a Kodi te matawai, te horoi rānei i te pātaka."

msgctxt "#32263"
msgid "Save and sync"
msgstr "Tiaki me te tukutahi"

msgctxt "#32264"
msgid "Unwatch %i items in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Me tohu %i tūemi kia kore e mātakitakina i Kodi kia ōrite ki a Trakt?"

msgctxt "#32265"
msgid "Clear %i ratings in Kodi to match Trakt?"
msgstr "Me ūkui %i whakatauranga i Kodi kia ōrite ki a Trakt?"
